SkyCache
Copyright 2026 SkyCache Contributors

This product includes software developed for community information access
in bandwidth-constrained environments.

SkyCache is receive-only by design and only targets unencrypted, free-to-air,
or openly licensed satellite signals and offline content packages.

Third-party tools commonly used alongside SkyCache (not bundled unless noted):
  - SatDump (satellite decoding)
  - gr-satellites (amateur satellite telemetry)
  - SoapySDR / RTL-SDR drivers
  - Kiwix (offline ZIM content)
  - hostapd / dnsmasq (local WiFi hotspot)

Operators must comply with local spectrum and telecommunications law.
